  "description": "More fun, more flow – uphill and downhill. With our new ALLMTN CF 10 TRN/IQ, you’ll experience all-mountain riding in its purest form. Equipped with the innovative Pinion Motor.Gearbox.Unit (MGU), this full-suspension eMTB offers the perfect balance of power and control. The drive unit combines the motor and gearing for an entirely new riding feel. Plus, the smart Auto-Shift technology ensures you’re always in the right gear – and in the flow. That’s not all: the lightweight carbon frame, short chainstays and 160mm of travel front and rear make this bike an agile trail surfer. And with the 800Wh battery, you’re ready for long mountain adventures filled with maximum riding fun and unbeatable flow.",
